escription:\nIn the year 4216, the planet XB5 is a battleground of power, rebellion, and strict conservation laws. For over 150 years, war has raged over limited habitable land, but when a catastrophic explosion uncovers Meel-an invaluable, all-purpose ore-the fate of the galaxy changes forever. Dictator Tote, who controls the Meel supply, has ambitions that threaten the balance of power across the universe. Centuries later, in 2185, Captain Cooper and his crew aboard the legendary Galaxy Clipper 1292 find themselves in the crosshairs of an unknown enemy. After an unwarranted attack on their unarmed vessel, they embark on a dangerous journey spanning multiple quadrants and galaxies. Alongside Ann Baker, Cooper must navigate treacherous alliances, uncover a sinister galactic conspiracy, and battle the oppressive forces of the Tote and his enslaved minions. With political intrigue, high-stakes space combat, and a fight for survival, The Galaxy Clipper is an epic science fiction adventure that will captivate fans of space opera, military sci-fi, and interstellar thrillers. Will Captain Cooper and his crew expose the truth and return home, or will they fall victim to the forces determined to control the universe?\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['scor