escription:\nA powerful children's book about bullying, courage, and finding your voice. When little Zoe starts school, she's full of excitement and hope-until something changes. On the school bus, two boys begin to bully her, leaving her confused, frightened, and silent. Zoe Stood Up to Her Bullies is a true story children's book that follows one brave little girl's emotional journey from silence to speaking up-with the loving support of her family. Perfect for readers aged 4-9, this anti-bullying story for kids gently teaches children how to recognize bullying, understand their feelings, and ask for help. It's a heartwarming message of courage, emotional support, and the importance of listening to children's voices. Parents, teachers, and caregivers will appreciate how this book opens conversations about: Bullying in school and on the bus Emotional safety and speaking up Christian values, family love, and support How to empower children to stand up for themselves Whether you're looking for children's books about courage, true story children's books, or a way to talk to your child about difficult emotions, Zoe Stood Up to Her Bullies is a gentle, inspiring choice. A must-have for every home, classroom, and Sunday school library.\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}