ical Romance Novel\n\nDescription:\nEnjoy this Victorian historical romance novel from best-selling author Tracy Cooper-Posey! The man she once loved is now a monster she doesnt know. In Degree of Solitude, love and tragedy intertwine in a tale of lost connection. Catrin and Daniel once shared a deep love, but Daniel, fearing that marriage would stifle Catrin's intellectual and personal freedom, refused to take their relationship further. Despite this, their lives remain intertwined. When Daniel is shot in the face during a family rescue mission in Algeria, he retreats to a remote village in Pembrokeshire, Wales, brutally severing ties with Catrin. Determined to find closure, Catrin travels to Wales, only to discover that the man she finds there is a shadow of the Daniel she once knew. Degree of Solitude is the ninth book in the Scandalous Scions series, an engrossing continuation of the acclaimed historical romance series, Scandalous Sirens. Set against the backdrop of the Victorian era, this series explores the complex relationships and passions of three prominent families, navigating love, loss, and societal expectations in a world of strict moral codes. Reader Advisory: This story contains frank sex scenes and sexual language. This story is part of the Scandalous Scions series: 0.5 Rose of Ebony 1.0 Soul of Sin 2.0 Valor of Love 3.0 Marriage of Lies 3.5 Scandalous Scions Boxed Set 1 4.0 Mask of Nobility 5.0 Law of Attraction 6.0 Veil of Honor 6.5 Scandalous Scions Boxed Set 2 7.0 Season of Denial 8.0 Rules of Engagement 9.0 Degree of Solitude 10.0 Ashes of Pride 11.0 Risk of Ruin 12.0 Year of Folly 13.0 Queen of Hearts A Sexy Historical Romance ___ Praise for Degree of Solitude: ...a delightfully happy ending which gave me warm fuzzy feelings. This is a welcome addition to one of my favourite series EVER. It is a swoon worthy love story with a little twist thrown in. Delightfully descriptive language that allows the reader to feel the constricting corsets and breathe deeply of the mountain air. On\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['score', 'reason'], 'title': 'RelevanceScore', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, 'name': 'RelevanceScore', 'strict': True}}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.0}}
