on\n\nDescription:\nEnter the enchanting yet treacherous "Sweet Realms of Deception: A Twisted Fairy Tale." This captivating novel reimagines classic fairy tale tropes, weaving a dark and compelling narrative that will leave you breathless. **Features: ** Immerse yourself in a richly detailed world filled with alluring characters, both wicked and virtuous. Experience a fast-paced plot brimming with unexpected twists and turns that will keep you guessing until the very end. Discover a unique blend of fantasy and dark romance, infused with breathtaking prose and evocative imagery. **Advantages: ** Unlike predictable fairy tales, "Sweet Realms of Deception" offers a thrilling, unpredictable journey. This isn\'t your grandmother\'s fairy tale; expect shocking revelations and morally ambiguous characters that challenge your perceptions. The intricate world-building and complex characters will stay with you long after you finish reading. **Benefits: ** * Experience a captivating escape into a world of magic and mystery. * Enjoy a thrilling and unpredictable plot filled with suspense. * Explore complex character development and morally grey areas. * Discover a unique twist on classic fairy tale narratives. * Indulge in a richly immersive reading experience that will linger in your mind.\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user\'s search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing a